{"content":[{"c":["AIN"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. City on the eastern border of Canaan, the Promised Land, northeast of the Sea of Galilee (",{"href":"?bref=Num.34.11","r":"Num.34.11","rawR":"Num.34.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.34.11","value":"Num.34.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 34:11"},"). The name means “well” or “spring.” It may be modern Khirbet ‘Ayyun."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Town in the territory of Simeon. Many (but not all) scholars consider the site to be En-rimmon (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.19.7","r":"Josh.19.7","rawR":"Josh.19.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.19.7","value":"Josh.19.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 19:7"},"; cf. ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.29","r":"Neh.11.29","rawR":"Neh.11.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.29","value":"Neh.11.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:29"},"), implying a copyist’s error that separated “Ain” from “Rimmon.” ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=EnRimmon_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"EnRimmon_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"EnRimmon_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"En-rimmon"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Place name in ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.21.16","r":"Josh.21.16","rawR":"Josh.21.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.21.16","value":"Josh.21.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Joshua 21:16"}," resulting from another scribal mistake due to similarity of the words “Ain” and “Ashan” in Hebrew. The correct spelling is Ashan (cf. ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.59","r":"1Chr.6.59","rawR":"1Chr.6.59","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.59","value":"1Chr.6.59"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:59"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Ashan_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Ashan_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Ashan_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Ashan"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Ain","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 34:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.34.11","rawQueryValue":"Num.34.11","sourceRefExact":"Num.34.11"},{"anchorText":"Jos 19:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.19.7","rawQueryValue":"Josh.19.7","sourceRefExact":"Josh.19.7"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.29","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.29","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.29"},{"anchorText":"Joshua 21:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.21.16","rawQueryValue":"Josh.21.16","sourceRefExact":"Josh.21.16"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:59","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.59","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.59","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.59"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"00d2afe06fcf9cfc3b2371f4cba286e57717fbe80c1c9a7ccc677f1e34abe4db","sourceItemName":"Ain","sourceItemOrder":219,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Ain","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Ain","title":"Ain","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}